---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
---
<Base lang="en" title="The Chronicle · Hortus de Escapismo"
      description="Fiction festivals, joint projects and lectures: the monastery's chronicle."
      active="activities" canvas="pollen">

<div class="wall-page">

  <div class="wall-head">
    <h1 class="latin" data-scramble="The Chronicle">The Chronicle</h1>
    <div class="wall-latin">活动志 · CHRONICLE</div>
    <svg id="vine" viewBox="0 0 420 40" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M10 30 C60 5 90 35 140 20 S240 5 290 22 S380 30 410 14 M70 24 q4 -10 12 -8 M210 18 q4 10 12 8 M330 22 q-6 -8 2 -14"/>
    </svg>
    <p class="mono meta">CHRONICLE · the house's great affairs, by year</p>
  </div>

  <div class="chronicle">

    <div class="chron-item ongoing">
      <div class="living" style="display:block;cursor:default">
        <div class="stem" style="padding:1.3rem 1.4rem 1.5rem">
          <span class="mono meta">Ongoing · year-round</span>
          <h3 style="margin:.35rem 0" class="latin">Open submissions<span class="badge-halo">ongoing</span></h3>
          <p>Novels, paintings, OCs, worldbuilding — any form. After the gardeners' cataloguing it is hung in <a href="/en/works/">the Garden</a>. See the WeChat backstage for how to submit.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="chron-item">
      <div class="living" style="display:block;cursor:default">
        <div class="stem" style="padding:1.3rem 1.4rem 1.5rem">
          <span class="mono meta">2024-06-01 · Fiction Festival</span>
          <h3 style="margin:.35rem 0" class="latin">1st "Gushihui" Fiction Festival — awards</h3>
          <p>The four prizes found their owners:</p>
          <ul style="margin:.2rem 0;font-size:.95rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">
            <li>Best Fantasy / Most Promising · 《杭城十二时辰》 — 魔王与小玖</li>
            <li>Best Sci-fi · 《你算命了吗》 — 旁观的好孩子</li>
            <li>Best Mystery · 《婺城午夜电台札记》 — 林子环</li>
            <li>Best Story / Best Characters · 《白银时代》 — 浮光</li>
          </ul>
          <p style="margin-bottom:0"><a href="/en/works/">To the Garden →</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="chron-item">
      <div class="living" style="display:block;cursor:default">
        <div class="stem" style="padding:1.3rem 1.4rem 1.5rem">
          <span class="mono meta">2024-05 · Fiction Festival</span>
          <h3 style="margin:.35rem 0" class="latin">1st Fiction Festival — call &amp; review</h3>
          <p>The club's first fiction festival. Submissions, peer review and the "editorially sanctioned masterpieces" selection all happened within the month.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="chron-item">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="mono meta">Earlier · founding</span>
        <h3 style="margin:.35rem 0" class="latin">The club is founded</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:0">Ground broken at Fudan. Not yet open to the public — we planted our own flowers first.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<Footer lang="en" mid="activities" />
</Base>
